<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia's TCV to offer A$100 mln 2008 bonds.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia's TCV to offer A$100 mln 2008 bonds.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury Corporation of Victoria (TCV) said it will offer A$100 million of 7.5 percent August 2008 stock at its tender on Monday.</p>
<p>The tender is scheduled for 10.30 a.m. local time (0030 GMT) and the result should be known shortly afterwards.</p>
<p>TCV is the borrowing arm of the state of Victoria.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
